{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/new-special.gif?t=1742941313\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>THE GIST</strong></i></u><strong></strong><br>YOYO PUNK is a Rope-Physics battleground. You play as a tough rebellious <strong>yoyo</strong>, swinging, flailing and crushing other yoyo opponents in intense, fast action, PVP combat arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>SMOOTH LIKE BUTTER</strong></i></u><br>After a long time of development, we're extremly proud of YOYO PUNK's intuitive grappling. try it for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>EASY TO WIN - HARD TO MASTER</strong></i></u><strong></strong><br>The large variety of traverse options allow you to optimize your locomotion, come at your opponnent as fast as you possibly can to\u00a0deliver powerful and accurate momentum-based attacks.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/extras/Steam_Punch_Footer.png?t=1742941313\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3109010?t=1742941313","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742941313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742941313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742941313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen",